            </note>
            <note corresp="#d943-f3" n="2" xml:id="d943-f3-content">
                <p>Department of State Treaty Series No. 990, or 59 Stat. 922.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d943-f4" n="3" xml:id="d943-f4-content">
                <p>By telegram No. 276, July 3, 2 p.m., the Ambassador was instructed to inform the
                    appropriate authorities that the President had approved the appointment of
                    Herschel V. Johnson, First Secretary, and Clifford C. Taylor, Agricultural
                    Attaché, American Embassy, London, as representatives of the United States
                    Government on the Provisional Sugar Council (561.35E1A/18).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
